orare il sentimento di un rapporto dimenticato, un evento inaspettato mette di nuovo a repentaglio tutto.","tagline":"Vi diranno che è una storia vera. Non credetegli."},{"language":"en-US","overview":"Flaminia De Angelis, a cheerful girl from North Rome, is obsessed with fitness and comes from a wealthy background. Under pressure from her mother, she is about to marry Alberto, the son of a diplomat, as a means to climb the social ladder. The arrival of her autistic half-sister, Ludovica, turns her life upside down, and an unexpected event puts everything at risk."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/g9BetYTe7MJfi9SRe3jvf1ea0dJ.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7qCggVYZndgRhYdh1ATEoy6wyfz.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":1140225,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"it-IT","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/g9BetYTe7MJfi9SRe3jvf1ea0dJ.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/g9BetYTe7MJfi9SRe3jvf1ea0dJ.jpg","language":"it","width":2000,"height":3000},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/g9BetYTe7MJfi9SRe3jvf1ea0dJ.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/g9BetYTe7MJfi9SRe3jvf1ea0dJ.jpg","language":"it","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1LCyc5pCiabH4K7GsoQ8j4jX5Bj.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/1LCyc5pCiabH4K7GsoQ8j4jX5Bj.jpg","language":"it","width":762,"height":1143}]},"en":{"status":"missing","candidates":[]},"xx":{"status":"missing","candidates":[]}},"background":{"it":{"status":"missing","candidates":[]},"en":{"status":"missing","candidates":[]},"xx":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"backdrop","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7qCggVYZndgRhYdh1ATEoy6wyfz.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.or